WEBVTT

00:41:56.226 --> 00:42:00.448
to needing to explain
why that happened the next,

00:42:00.472 --> 00:42:01.947
and were you involved?

00:42:02.792 --> 00:42:06.907
You almost had to defend
your career decisions

00:42:06.931 --> 00:42:11.922
in this way that was
completely unexpected,

00:42:11.946 --> 00:42:17.777
and you had zero input
or effect on that being the case.

00:42:18.225 --> 00:42:21.186
So I think that was really tricky,

00:42:21.210 --> 00:42:24.832
and that is part of why, I think,
career decisions and job decisions

00:42:24.856 --> 00:42:28.865
are so heavy for people,

00:42:28.889 --> 00:42:31.680
because there is this aspect
of the unknown